        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production TT, at evaporation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production TT, at evaporation plant
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=ee67ddc1-fd44-38c7-9737-c9dce376ecea
This dataset describes the gasification of Trinidadian and Tobagan natural gas in a Polish evaporation plant.
Location: Global data for energy requirements combined and natural gas characteristics. 
Technology: European technology average.
Time period: Data on energy use for the evaporation stems of a review of common technologies from 2017 and 2019.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ee67ddc1-fd44-38c7-9737-c9dce376ecea.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
